      "text": "Saint Meinrad Archabbey, founded in 1854 by monks from Switzerland’s Einsiedeln Abbey, remains one of only two archabbeys in the United States.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
