      ],
      "source": "https://www.prismnews.com/news/saint-meinrad-archabbey-in-dubois-county-offers-history-tours-visitor-services",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The abbey’s mile‑long Marian Shrine Trail winds past Stations of the Cross and ends at a shrine to the Blessed Mother, inviting walkers at any time.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.prismnews.com/news/saint-meinrad-archabbey-in-dubois-county-offers-history-tours-visitor-services",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Every weekday, more than 80 Benedictine monks gather five times to pray the Liturgy of the Hours and celebrate Mass in the Archabbey Church.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.prismnews.com/news/saint-meinrad-archabbey-in-dubois-county-offers-history-tours-visitor-services",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Saint Meinrad’s Guest House offers overnight stays for out‑of‑town visitors, and retreat schedules can be picked up there for a quiet weekend of reflection.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
